              	;; ===============================================================
              	;; Fills a block of memory with a byte
              	;; IN:  A  - byte
              	;;      HL - start address
              	;;      BC - number of bytes
              	;; OUT: HL - address of last byte filled
              	;;      DE - address of first byte following the last byte filled
